      "original_tokenized_text": "Se lasciano la grotta,\nnon li riacciufferemo più!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Non lasciateli fuggire!<C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "2": {
      "text": "Aaah... La brezza salmastra\ndi questa grotta...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0004,>Mi mancava. Temevo di non\npoterla assaporare mai più!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "tokenized_text": "Aaah... La brezza salmastra\ndi questa grotta...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0004,>Mi mancava. Temevo di non\npoterla assaporare mai più!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_text": "Aaah... La brezza salmastra\ndi questa grotta...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0004,>Mi mancava. Temevo di non\npoterla assaporare mai più!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "Aaah... La brezza salmastra\ndi questa grotta...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0004,>Mi mancava. Temevo di non\npoterla assaporare mai più!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
