      "text": "Questa grotta era il\nnascondiglio dei pirati.<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>La leggenda parla di\nun grande tesoro...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0004,>... ma di cosa si tratta?\nChe mistero...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
